Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比 把球捡给我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.17,0:01:06.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.98,0:01:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:22.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐 别怕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.28,0:01:24.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:26.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,X-SE01型
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.69,0:01:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王陛下下令
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.59,0:01:31.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要把你带往改造工厂
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.49,0:01:32.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.49,0:01:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.99,0:01:34.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.33,0:01:36.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.23,0:01:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.74,0:01:48.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克 就算剩你一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.34,0:01:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也要逃走喔
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.34,0:01:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要跟妈妈在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.29,0:02:04.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.86,0:02:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.79,0:02:06.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.99,0:02:08.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:12.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把T-01 02
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.70,0:02:15.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带往改造工厂
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.00,0:02:19.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.11,0:02:22.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克 你要逃出去喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.31,0:02:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.55,0:03:06.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.25,0:03:07.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,T-02
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:08.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,T-02 站住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.03,0:03:11.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.86,0:03:13.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:40.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖 坐下…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.66,0:03:42.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很棒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的宠物机器狗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.43,0:03:46.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可爱唷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.66,0:03:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 握手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.36,0:03:50.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,握手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.66,0:03:52.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,握手
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.93,0:03:54.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛耶
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.17,0:03:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.51,0:04:00.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是我爸爸的公司
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新发售的机器狗皮皮喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:06.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 好好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:08.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 好羡慕你喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.28,0:04:10.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我还是比较喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.28,0:04:13.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器无尾熊耶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.86,0:04:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至于我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.02,0:04:18.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用说当然是机器狮子喽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.16,0:04:23.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是喜欢比较厉害的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.73,0:04:25.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我的话 我喜欢…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.23,0:04:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得大雄很适合青蛙耶
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.17,0:04:30.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,青蛙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.74,0:04:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.11,0:04:40.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你喜欢什么呀 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:45.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.39,0:04:49.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,的确是大雄会喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.19,0:04:50.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就叫你的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮你买机器水母好了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:54.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好不好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.13,0:04:59.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.90,0:05:02.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:06.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈 我想要宠物…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.21,0:05:08.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过了不能养宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.58,0:05:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.58,0:05:10.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是宠物机…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.64,0:05:11.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是你不是已经
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有宠物机了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.28,0:05:16.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.42,0:05:18.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是宠物机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:19.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说不行就是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.85,0:05:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶快去写你的功课
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.29,0:05:23.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.93,0:05:27.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还是叫哆啦A梦给我好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.73,0:05:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宠物机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.30,0:05:32.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是已经有我这一只
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.60,0:05:34.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器猫了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.37,0:05:35.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.30,0:05:37.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你根本就不像宠物嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.17,0:05:38.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:39.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一点都不听我的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.44,0:05:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么能算是你的主人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.51,0:05:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是泄气耶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.05,0:05:46.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了要让你成为
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:47.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个成熟的大人
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.31,0:05:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我特地从22世纪来到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.52,0:05:50.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果什么事情都听你的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:53.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我哪敢听你的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.45,0:05:54.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要了解我的苦心
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.96,0:05:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.62,0:05:57.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又开始说教了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:05:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要搞清楚喔
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.76,0:06:01.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不是自动贩卖机喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.13,0:06:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 让开…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.13,0:06:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在忙得很呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.40,0:06:08.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.34,0:06:10.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.07,0:06:11.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是大雄太任性了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.84,0:06:12.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才耽误了一点时间…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.77,0:06:15.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.84,0:06:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我们可以走了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.58,0:06:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:22.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.22,0:06:25.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是忙着跟小咪约会啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.79,0:06:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.36,0:06:36.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的空间袋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.87,0:06:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.51,0:06:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.07,0:06:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要抓了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.11,0:06:50.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.44,0:06:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痒好痒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.81,0:06:53.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要抓了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.81,0:06:56.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一定是大雄做的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.08,0:06:57.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把我的空间袋…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.89,0:07:00.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空间袋…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.27,0:07:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.04,0:07:17.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来百货公司邮购机
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.04,0:07:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢您的惠顾
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:22.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请订购您所需要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.54,0:07:24.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人的目录…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:26.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪里啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.15,0:07:29.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.42,0:07:30.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.05,0:07:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们有没有水母机器人…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:34.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.86,0:07:37.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停不下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么搞的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:40.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便按好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.13,0:07:42.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,订购键
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.80,0:07:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢您的订购…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.00,0:07:52.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢您的订购…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.98,0:08:30.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.41,0:08:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办才好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.18,0:08:39.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.80,0:08:58.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(哆啦A梦)\N(大雄与机器人王国)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.96,0:09:56.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.66,0:09:59.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,楼上是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.73,0:10:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.74,0:10:04.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.14,0:10:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是太荣幸了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.11,0:10:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天能够跟您认识
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.14,0:10:12.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是挖地瓜机器人康助
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.78,0:10:15.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问您有地瓜要挖吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.55,0:10:18.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们全都给我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.19,0:10:19.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.79,0:10:25.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们回来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.13,0:10:26.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.13,0:10:28.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.40,0:10:31.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小咪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.13,0:10:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天真的很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:36.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见喽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.37,0:10:39.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:41.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.41,0:10:44.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.55,0:10:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是滚筒机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.15,0:10:53.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怎么会在这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.89,0:10:59.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,街上全部都是机器人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.69,0:11:00.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.73,0:11:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道说这又是大雄的杰作吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.73,0:11:05.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便乱丢垃圾…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要罚一千块
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.20,0:11:09.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随便乱丢垃圾…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.07,0:11:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一千块
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.74,0:11:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这家伙是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:13.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁快来赶走它呀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.47,0:11:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快走开啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.58,0:11:20.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要罚一千块…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.45,0:11:22.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是罚钱箱耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.05,0:11:26.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.23,0:11:37.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 不要这样好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.26,0:11:38.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.27,0:11:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底做了什么好事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.10,0:11:41.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挖地瓜呀挖地瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挖地瓜呀挖地瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.44,0:11:47.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿咻嘿咻…挖地瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.14,0:11:51.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挖地瓜机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.88,0:11:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也需要挖地瓜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.78,0:11:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我讨厌打针啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.62,0:11:58.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊 妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.49,0:12:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打针…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.29,0:12:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.30,0:12:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮皮 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:12.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:18.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的皮皮变成了猫了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.14,0:12:21.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.78,0:12:23.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:25.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.01,0:12:26.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样的啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:27.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:28.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说来的话
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:30.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些机器人全都是你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.28,0:12:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟未来百货公司订来的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.25,0:12:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的零用钱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.16,0:12:37.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本就付不起嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么办哪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.03,0:12:41.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要赶快退货才行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.93,0:12:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退货机
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:49.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就可以退货了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.34,0:12:52.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挖地瓜…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.44,0:12:53.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罚钱
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.41,0:12:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我下来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.21,0:13:03.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮皮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.93,0:13:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一定\N是哆啦A梦的道具害的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:27.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是大雄那个臭家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:29.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一次把我们害惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:31.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是把我给吓坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.71,0:13:35.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点把我的皮皮恢复原状啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:38.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.05,0:13:40.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪我太不小心了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.95,0:13:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.89,0:13:44.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明明就是一条狗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:45.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然喵喵叫
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.73,0:13:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死人了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.09,0:13:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.50,0:13:51.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 不要这样啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.73,0:13:54.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.40,0:13:58.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛喔\N皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.91,0:13:59.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.47,0:14:01.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 你快点想想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.47,0:14:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:07.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它根本就不听我的话呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.76,0:14:17.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.53,0:14:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.17,0:14:28.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点拿什么道具出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:30.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啦 我找找看啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.05,0:14:43.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快点爬到水泥管上面
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.79,0:14:49.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.76,0:14:51.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以这样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.17,0:15:07.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.28,0:15:18.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.45,0:15:21.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是担心这个的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.15,0:15:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:25.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:27.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,振作一点哪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.93,0:15:33.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个孩子是机器人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.10,0:15:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也是被你\N叫出来的机器人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.44,0:15:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.57,0:15:38.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有可能喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.20,0:15:40.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过 真的很奇怪耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.51,0:15:42.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么只有这个机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.08,0:15:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有办法退货呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:45.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来查查看喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.21,0:15:47.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,壁纸秘密基地
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.61,0:15:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了避人耳目
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.68,0:15:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就在这里面进行好了…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.20,0:16:03.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点也没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.53,0:16:05.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说没错是什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.63,0:16:06.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.47,0:16:09.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并不是这个地球的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.74,0:16:10.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.34,0:16:13.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦也没有办法修理喽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.01,0:16:14.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他身上的零件
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是我没有看过的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.91,0:16:17.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,材质也不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.21,0:16:18.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是在某个星球
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.24,0:16:19.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被制造出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.61,0:16:21.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为什么会跑来地球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.55,0:16:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想一定是我胡搞瞎搞
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:25.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才会把他弄到地球上来的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.99,0:16:26.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.85,0:16:29.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这全都是你不好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.29,0:16:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要振作一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.36,0:16:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.16,0:16:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不快点想办法的话\N就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.03,0:16:37.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.56,0:16:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就快点想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有什么办法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:41.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.63,0:16:43.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有什么办法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.17,0:16:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.17,0:16:45.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么做呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.91,0:16:47.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来只好把这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.54,0:16:49.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带回去他原来的世界了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.24,0:16:49.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.68,0:16:50.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.91,0:16:52.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是不知道在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.25,0:16:54.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是在遥远的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:55.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要冒险的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.15,0:16:56.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最在行了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.45,0:16:57.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们也许会碰到很多危险喔
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.79,0:17:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不怕
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.92,0:17:02.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要我们能够救这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.96,0:17:04.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不要再啰哩巴嗦的了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:06.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.43,0:17:08.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.26,0:17:09.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.13,0:17:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追根究底来说
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.26,0:17:13.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这全都是你的皮皮害的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.17,0:17:14.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去就是了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.33,0:17:15.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.37,0:17:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.94,0:17:17.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 就这么决定
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.70,0:17:19.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们大家一起把这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:22.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,送回去他的星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.71,0:17:24.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.24,0:17:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.51,0:17:27.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,代替全宇宙的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.38,0:17:29.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向你们几位致谢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.68,0:17:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 我们出发喽
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.23,0:17:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个时间与空间导航
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.97,0:17:47.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以帮助我们找到
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.97,0:17:50.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这孩子来的时候的路线
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.17,0:17:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个机器
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.97,0:17:52.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.97,0:17:54.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在结草虫式的睡袋里头
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是非常安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.18,0:17:59.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提起精神来啊 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.25,0:18:01.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然是有很多机器人的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.38,0:18:03.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说不定你可以要一个回来喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.72,0:18:05.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的也是喔
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.72,0:18:08.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:10.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们即将要进入
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.99,0:18:12.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时空迷路了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.99,0:18:13.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.96,0:18:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们马上就要进入
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.93,0:18:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时空的迷宫里了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.03,0:18:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位一定要抓稳了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.01,0:18:32.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 千万不能放手啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.06,0:18:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看样子好像稳定下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.83,0:18:55.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会不会迷路了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.54,0:18:58.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前仍在继续导航中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.24,0:19:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.04,0:19:00.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.97,0:19:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是穿过这里去到地球的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.35,0:19:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逮捕未处理的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.95,0:19:13.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.75,0:19:14.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.72,0:19:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有人在看着我耶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.99,0:19:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快抓紧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.57,0:19:27.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们想干什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.58,0:19:38.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追过来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:40.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.01,0:19:40.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.91,0:19:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之先逃了再说
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.38,0:19:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不用你提醒
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.49,0:19:55.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我们撞上了时空墙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.63,0:19:57.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.10,0:19:59.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不用说…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.20,0:20:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然是粉身碎骨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.87,0:20:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是因为这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.77,0:20:05.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要来的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.31,0:20:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛为了一个
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.01,0:20:07.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来路不明的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.11,0:20:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么卖命嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.15,0:20:13.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.15,0:20:15.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.32,0:20:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.33,0:20:30.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自动操纵装置故障了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.90,0:20:33.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁赶紧去抓紧操纵杆
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.71,0:20:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.35,0:20:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:48.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是时空洞耶
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.38,0:20:49.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就好比时空中
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.25,0:20:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,产生的小型台风一样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.18,0:20:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是撞上时空洞的话
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.95,0:20:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们就完蛋了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:56.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意前方
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:59.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁赶紧去握紧操纵杆
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.06,0:21:06.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.60,0:21:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一个又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.00,0:21:09.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我来做的话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.00,0:21:11.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是做得到的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.74,0:21:19.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 这里就交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.52,0:21:25.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 从现在开始
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.39,0:21:27.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,操纵杆就拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.89,0:21:31.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.31,0:21:54.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.11,0:21:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经顺利到达
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.18,0:21:56.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目的地第二世界
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.82,0:21:58.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束声音导航
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.85,0:21:59.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.49,0:22:09.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 慢慢的往后退…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.34,0:22:17.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是好险喔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.01,0:23:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们大家都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.42,0:23:05.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.65,0:23:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还好啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.15,0:23:08.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次都这样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.76,0:23:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.86,0:23:12.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个孩子…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.20,0:23:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.80,0:23:18.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没事
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.43,0:23:22.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是那个孩子的世界吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.11,0:23:37.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个地方果然不是地球
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.62,0:23:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.82,0:23:41.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要跑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.72,0:23:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.43,0:23:48.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有房子耶
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.63,0:23:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 这里有房子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.60,0:23:52.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.10,0:23:53.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵吵闹闹的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.90,0:23:55.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.90,0:23:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.34,0:23:59.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是什么可疑的人啦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.91,0:24:00.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.91,0:24:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.64,0:24:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来不太像可疑的人 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.05,0:24:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可爱喔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.52,0:24:11.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的机器人助手
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.42,0:24:12.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫克鲁林
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.55,0:24:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多指教 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.86,0:24:17.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是稀客啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.79,0:24:19.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫欧拿贝
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.16,0:24:20.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这个管家机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.56,0:24:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是拥有一级证书的呦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.40,0:24:26.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.77,0:24:29.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是三级机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.20,0:24:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做查贝克 是个人类
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.84,0:24:34.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是机器人的医生
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.64,0:24:35.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人的医生
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.94,0:24:37.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那真是太好了耶 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.94,0:24:39.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.11,0:24:40.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做野比大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.41,0:24:42.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是个人类
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.68,0:24:45.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实…我们…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.29,0:24:47.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.62,0:24:50.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我从来没听过的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.79,0:24:53.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把他送到那儿去了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.49,0:24:54.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我的实验
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.96,0:24:57.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出现了意外的状况…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.53,0:24:59.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么样的实验
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.70,0:25:01.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.64,0:25:04.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个别碰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.37,0:25:05.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.54,0:25:07.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是动到了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.48,0:25:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是刚才那只鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.35,0:25:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个传送机好巧不巧的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.22,0:25:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那个孩子送到超空间里
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.99,0:25:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好跟你们的机器\N连结在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.63,0:25:28.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查贝克博士的实验
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.40,0:25:31.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本就没有用 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.06,0:25:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,话可不能这么说喔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.37,0:25:34.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人跟人类
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.73,0:25:36.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起在这个星球上生活
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.37,0:25:37.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.44,0:25:39.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.87,0:25:40.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.77,0:25:41.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才那个机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.91,0:25:43.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要追我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.74,0:25:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.28,0:25:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 饭菜都准备好了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.55,0:25:52.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的肚子快要饿扁了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.12,0:25:54.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的肚子不像是扁的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.56,0:25:57.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家别客气 尽量吃
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.42,0:25:59.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧拿贝可是料理铁人喔
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.76,0:26:01.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欧拿贝本来就是…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.59,0:26:03.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.76,0:26:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们太抬举我了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.20,0:26:09.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我要开动喽
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.87,0:26:15.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.08,0:26:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.54,0:26:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超赞的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.58,0:26:19.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我这辈子吃过
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.05,0:26:20.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好吃的东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.95,0:26:22.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你平常都是吃什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.78,0:26:23.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.78,0:26:24.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.95,0:26:26.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然大家这么喜欢我的菜
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.72,0:26:29.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就端出我的拿手点心
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.19,0:26:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.22,0:26:32.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好期待喔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.63,0:26:35.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来 这可是相当新鲜的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.60,0:26:38.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请享用吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.98,0:26:52.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个星球是个开拓星
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.15,0:26:53.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么是开拓星啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.68,0:26:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开拓星
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.65,0:26:56.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是开拓没有人住过的星球
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.88,0:26:58.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建造一个新的国家
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.95,0:27:00.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.12,0:27:02.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开自己的星球故乡
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.92,0:27:05.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,踏上这个星球的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.19,0:27:08.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比人类还要多
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.62,0:27:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类对待机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.62,0:27:33.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像是自己的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.42,0:27:36.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及谈天的对象
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.16,0:27:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人的人工智慧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.16,0:27:41.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也急速进化
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.16,0:27:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于和人类一样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.30,0:27:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有同样的心与感情
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.70,0:27:52.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.14,0:27:54.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却把机器人当做是奴隶
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.87,0:27:56.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他们变成了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.38,0:28:00.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只听从人类\N的忠实道具来使唤
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.38,0:28:03.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是她的机器人改造计划
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.68,0:28:05.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人改造计划
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.75,0:28:06.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.92,0:28:08.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太无法无天了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.19,0:28:10.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 真是可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.01,0:28:31.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔司令官
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.08,0:28:33.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捕捉机器人的工作 进行得怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.85,0:28:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王 您不需要担心
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.88,0:28:40.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一切都交给我来处理
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.39,0:28:42.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的部下多洛伊德兵
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.72,0:28:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经顺利的在进行
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.36,0:28:46.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并且成果卓著
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.96,0:29:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.36,0:29:21.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您为什么唯独\N不改造玛莉亚呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.70,0:29:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫非是因为
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.96,0:29:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是您的养育机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.67,0:29:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您可千万别忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.20,0:29:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您的父王是怎么死的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.84,0:29:33.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是因为把机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.54,0:29:35.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也当做是人类才会…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.44,0:29:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.28,0:29:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人只不过\N是人类的道具罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.16,0:29:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.36,0:29:58.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去尿尿
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.58,0:30:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.22,0:30:18.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经醒过来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.52,0:30:19.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.82,0:30:21.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.29,0:30:23.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫做野比大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.02,0:30:24.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.12,0:30:26.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是波克
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.09,0:30:28.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.63,0:30:30.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的身体还没有恢复呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.83,0:30:31.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.90,0:30:33.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.73,0:30:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈\N被多洛伊德兵给抓走了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.60,0:30:37.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去救她
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.90,0:30:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.61,0:30:39.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.94,0:30:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.04,0:30:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一个人根本就没有办法的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.38,0:30:45.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.05,0:30:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.75,0:30:50.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查贝克博士
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.25,0:30:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太逞强了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.85,0:30:55.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身体都还没完全恢复呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.42,0:30:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怜喔
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.26,0:30:59.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说波克的妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.36,0:31:01.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很可能被改造了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.70,0:31:04.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.76,0:31:06.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.65,0:31:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把门打开
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.59,0:31:27.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛莉亚
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.09,0:31:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.22,0:31:29.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.09,0:31:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克他怎么样了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.06,0:31:33.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我变成怎么样都无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.89,0:31:36.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 请您放过波克吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.33,0:31:38.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我求求您
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.06,0:31:39.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.10,0:31:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.47,0:31:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您做错了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.57,0:31:42.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您怎么可以
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.67,0:31:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把机器人\N当做是唯一的道具呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.07,0:31:48.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您快觉醒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.41,0:31:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住口
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.38,0:31:52.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个机器人\N竟敢命令人类…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.75,0:31:54.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.81,0:31:57.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.42,0:32:00.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个房间不准任何人进去
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.66,0:32:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛莉亚还有波克
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.39,0:32:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得先除掉这两个人才行…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.74,0:32:17.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.37,0:32:19.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.21,0:32:21.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.98,0:32:22.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.94,0:32:24.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.14,0:32:25.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.81,0:32:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是X-01型的工作机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.62,0:32:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请主人尽量交代工作
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.55,0:32:35.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快点来玩球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.22,0:32:37.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要丢喽
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.89,0:32:42.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.63,0:32:46.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是X-01型的工作机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.27,0:32:50.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请主人尽量交代工作
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.10,0:32:51.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.40,0:32:52.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗比他…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.94,0:32:55.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.64,0:32:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.61,0:33:00.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到处都找不到人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.58,0:33:02.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会跑到什么地方去呢
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.28,0:33:02.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.92,0:33:04.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定是去找他的妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.78,0:33:06.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是这样没错
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.12,0:33:08.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有可能是跑去宫殿了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.59,0:33:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能不管他
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.66,0:33:12.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连波克都会被抓去改造的…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.09,0:33:13.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要快去找他
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.73,0:33:15.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让克鲁林帮你们带路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.96,0:33:17.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.20,0:33:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.10,0:33:22.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这一身打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.27,0:33:24.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会引起别人的怀疑的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.24,0:33:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换装照相机
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.11,0:33:33.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.61,0:33:35.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.28,0:33:37.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们出发吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.88,0:34:12.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.85,0:34:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.72,0:34:17.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是F-01女佣型机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.00,0:34:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现未处理的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.65,0:35:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 他在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.11,0:35:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.08,0:35:18.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有什么武器啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.72,0:35:21.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的道具全部都掉了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.49,0:35:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,延长手臂
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.89,0:35:25.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.89,0:35:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.50,0:35:31.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.53,0:35:34.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.67,0:35:37.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要抓紧喔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.40,0:35:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.60,0:35:40.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.47,0:35:42.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.44,0:35:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.04,0:35:47.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去的话太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.75,0:35:49.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都可能会被抓走的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.65,0:35:51.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.00,0:36:12.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.04,0:36:14.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.31,0:36:15.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这些人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.17,0:36:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可以这么野蛮嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.14,0:36:19.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.15,0:36:25.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.99,0:36:27.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们想干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.92,0:36:29.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.22,0:36:32.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是这个星球的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.66,0:36:35.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是从哪来的狸型机器人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.56,0:36:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不是狸呢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.96,0:36:39.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个猫型机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.80,0:36:42.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟敢这么放肆
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.97,0:36:44.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.20,0:36:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只不过是人类\N忠实的道具罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.21,0:36:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我听好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.48,0:36:51.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是从地球来的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.04,0:36:53.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说的话根本就不算数
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.55,0:36:54.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.95,0:36:56.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听都没听过
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.68,0:36:58.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来可能是银河的尽头
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.95,0:37:00.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小的像尘土的星球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.82,0:37:02.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.26,0:37:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球比你们这个星球\N还要漂亮多了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.53,0:37:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.89,0:37:09.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒想试试
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.20,0:37:10.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个从什么地球来的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.56,0:37:13.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人性能如何
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.60,0:37:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.14,0:37:19.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把他关进大牢里去
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.27,0:37:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我回来
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.74,0:37:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干什么
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.41,0:37:23.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.61,0:37:24.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.88,0:37:30.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们到底要对我怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.62,0:37:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是从地球来的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.55,0:37:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.72,0:37:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们对我要客气一点
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.03,0:37:40.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.49,0:37:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.36,0:37:44.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吓我一大跳
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.10,0:37:45.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.13,0:37:46.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.13,0:37:49.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在地球出生的猫型机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.10,0:37:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本就不是他们说的狸啦
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.77,0:37:52.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.51,0:37:55.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道你是波克的…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.14,0:37:56.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说波克
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.24,0:37:59.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道波克他的下落是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.11,0:38:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个孩子他平安无事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.65,0:38:02.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.18,0:38:04.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很好
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.75,0:38:06.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.79,0:38:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是吓我一大跳
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.79,0:38:47.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父王…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.14,0:38:58.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王的父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.34,0:38:59.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德姆国王
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.84,0:39:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他让人类跟机器人同心协力
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.11,0:39:08.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要把这个星球建造成一个\N丰富的国家
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.21,0:39:10.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王在很小的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.28,0:39:12.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母亲就过世了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.28,0:39:13.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从那之后
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.32,0:39:15.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就负责照顾珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.45,0:39:17.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她也成了波克的玩伴
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.46,0:39:20.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个人是一起长大的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.49,0:39:22.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾德姆国王
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.03,0:39:24.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为了开垦荒芜的大地
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.76,0:39:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲自带头指挥开拓的工程
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.32,0:39:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.52,0:39:51.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到却招来了不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.93,0:39:58.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险哪
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.54,0:40:06.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.54,0:40:08.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父王
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.34,0:40:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.04,0:40:21.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王陛下…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.52,0:40:26.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国王陛下过世之后
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.59,0:40:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王继承了王位
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.33,0:40:33.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却听信邪恶司令官\N铁斯塔的话
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.20,0:40:36.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这全都是机器人害的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.34,0:40:37.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是因为他们
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.34,0:40:39.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拥有跟人类一样的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.47,0:40:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以国王陛下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.61,0:40:42.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才会舍身救他们
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.37,0:40:43.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.61,0:40:45.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像变了个人似的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.28,0:40:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下令改造机器人…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.81,0:40:50.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是因为父亲的死
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.68,0:40:52.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让她过于哀伤
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.22,0:40:55.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是她能够\N醒悟过来就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.20,0:41:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.70,0:41:06.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.83,0:41:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.23,0:41:10.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了啦 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.24,0:41:12.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.24,0:41:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了啦 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.27,0:41:14.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林 怎么了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.97,0:41:15.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.91,0:41:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像要参加钢铁对战耶
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.44,0:41:19.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.81,0:41:21.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钢铁对战
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.41,0:41:22.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克 那是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.95,0:41:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们让机器人彼此战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.02,0:41:26.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.89,0:41:28.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 我们走
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.29,0:41:29.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.12,0:41:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.62,0:41:31.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快点帮我们带路
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.05,0:41:57.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.75,0:41:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.32,0:42:00.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好啦…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.05,0:42:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才的比赛是佛克斯A获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.62,0:42:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,输的话要被当成废铁处理帕
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.19,0:42:08.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.16,0:42:08.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.89,0:42:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太可恶了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.20,0:42:13.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们快点看那里
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.00,0:42:14.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她就是珍娜
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.40,0:42:16.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在她旁边的就是铁斯塔
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.97,0:42:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.17,0:42:21.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一场比赛会很精彩喔
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.05,0:42:30.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来的赛程是…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.32,0:42:32.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从遥远的银河边界来的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.95,0:42:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.52,0:42:35.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.29,0:42:36.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.56,0:42:37.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很痛耶
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.42,0:42:39.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.39,0:42:41.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.80,0:42:45.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们到底要干什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.93,0:42:49.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.03,0:42:50.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在出去太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.47,0:42:52.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要伺机而动
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.47,0:42:57.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的对手是金刚费达
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.08,0:42:58.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对战300回合以来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.54,0:43:01.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无败绩的战士
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.18,0:43:04.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎 金刚费达
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.45,0:43:10.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦打不赢他的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.36,0:43:12.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且他手上也没有武器
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.52,0:43:14.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先别急
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.46,0:43:18.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大只喔
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.77,0:43:22.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚铁对战 比赛开始
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.14,0:43:34.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,武士是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.54,0:43:59.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.30,0:44:01.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么武器啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.17,0:44:02.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.78,0:44:05.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,定时笨蛋炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.68,0:44:08.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间设定为五秒
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.53,0:44:25.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来呀…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.00,0:44:27.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大头大头下雨不用愁
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.04,0:44:32.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦激怒金刚的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.07,0:44:35.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个是定时笨蛋炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.34,0:44:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然瞧不起我\N跳起舞来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.01,0:44:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.28,0:44:47.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个笨蛋 跳够了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.19,0:44:48.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有什么武器啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.69,0:44:52.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实物影印机
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.10,0:45:01.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.31,0:45:07.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.64,0:45:08.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然如此
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.67,0:45:10.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先打旁边的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.16,0:45:33.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要几个就有几个
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.47,0:45:35.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 做得好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.33,0:45:38.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会上当的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.34,0:45:42.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一口气把你们解决
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.12,0:45:54.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.19,0:46:04.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看还有什么东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.53,0:46:07.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逗人笑跳蚤
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.89,0:46:29.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逗人笑跳蚤跑到我的身上了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.45,0:46:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然又跳又笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.02,0:46:33.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脑子有问题啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.63,0:46:35.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.33,0:46:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.16,0:46:40.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还不怕吗
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.62,0:47:02.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.57,0:47:18.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.47,0:47:20.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,优胜者是地球来的机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.71,0:47:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.94,0:47:25.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.14,0:47:26.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.65,0:47:27.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好耶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.71,0:47:29.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 好厉害唷
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.72,0:47:31.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真有你的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.15,0:47:36.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金刚先生
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.09,0:47:38.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实真正厉害的人是你哟
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.39,0:47:40.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.16,0:47:41.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我刚才
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.46,0:47:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耍了一点小小的手段
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.60,0:47:44.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.13,0:47:46.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的很聪明
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.00,0:47:48.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我输了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.23,0:47:49.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没出息
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.60,0:47:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是因为那些\N没用的感情做祟
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.34,0:47:53.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.41,0:47:55.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请立刻下改造令吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.14,0:47:56.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.41,0:47:59.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在立刻把金刚\N带到改造工厂去
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.51,0:48:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求您 不要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.38,0:48:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.48,0:48:06.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求您饶过我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.29,0:48:09.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 现在机会来了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.22,0:48:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.16,0:48:13.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.36,0:48:15.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁现在赶快逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.33,0:48:18.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不快把金刚带走
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.26,0:48:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.33,0:48:21.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快回来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.13,0:48:22.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.80,0:48:24.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们这么做真是太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.84,0:48:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然任意夺走机器人的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.34,0:48:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人只要当个
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.71,0:48:32.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顺从人类的道具就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.18,0:48:33.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你错了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.18,0:48:34.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦他才不是道具
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.91,0:48:37.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.78,0:48:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.42,0:48:41.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.05,0:48:41.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.92,0:48:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你快点停止改造机器人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.72,0:48:46.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我妈妈还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.36,0:48:48.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我求求你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.46,0:48:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这个无礼之徒
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.96,0:48:52.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.23,0:48:54.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去把那些人抓起来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.77,0:48:56.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.34,0:48:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋 快点追啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.24,0:49:02.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.05,0:49:12.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.95,0:49:15.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:19.86,0:49:21.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.73,0:49:23.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管他们逃到哪去
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.60,0:49:25.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发信器发出的电波
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.56,0:49:27.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都追踪得到
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.45,0:49:44.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.72,0:49:46.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克已经恢复精神了呀
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.79,0:49:47.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.65,0:49:50.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那波克的妈妈怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.12,0:49:52.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞不好他妈妈\N已经被改造了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.62,0:49:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.79,0:49:58.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她到现在还没有被改造喔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.53,0:50:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经见过她了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.60,0:50:01.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你见到我妈妈了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.87,0:50:03.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 虽然她被关起来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.84,0:50:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是她还是
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.40,0:50:06.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直很担心你的事喔
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.24,0:50:07.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.87,0:50:08.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.61,0:50:10.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能就这样丢着不管
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.01,0:50:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.94,0:50:13.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.65,0:50:15.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.52,0:50:22.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.35,0:50:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是多洛伊德兵
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.89,0:50:25.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.89,0:50:28.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们被人家跟踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.36,0:50:30.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁还来得及 你们快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.36,0:50:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要逃去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.06,0:50:33.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃往西边去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.97,0:50:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的目标是\N荒野尽头的人面岩
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.00,0:50:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 人面岩
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.04,0:50:40.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快呀
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.34,0:50:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家动作快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.01,0:50:46.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始动了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.08,0:50:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道被发现了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.98,0:50:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.58,0:50:54.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克跟那些人往西边走了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.92,0:50:58.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是您亲自率队\N逮捕他的时候了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.89,0:51:01.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您不快点动身的话
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.49,0:51:03.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事情会很难收拾的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.46,0:51:05.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.43,0:51:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这就出发
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.11,0:51:20.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了 我的竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.71,0:51:22.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.01,0:51:24.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法了 先降落吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.12,0:51:29.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从这里开始我们得用走的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.32,0:51:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是谷底
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.12,0:51:32.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本就不晓得方向啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.06,0:51:33.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个就交给我了 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.99,0:51:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西边是…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.06,0:51:38.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.20,0:51:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.03,0:51:41.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会错吧
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.07,0:51:48.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这样往西走
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.07,0:51:50.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底会有什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.71,0:51:51.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.48,0:51:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我妈妈她常告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.28,0:51:56.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个叫做“虹之谷”的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.41,0:51:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虹之谷的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.15,0:52:01.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有个故障的火箭
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.79,0:52:03.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飘流到某个星球上
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.42,0:52:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火箭上的机器人跟少年
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.53,0:52:09.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个人开始往西边旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.90,0:52:11.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚开始两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.16,0:52:13.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不停的有过争吵
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.10,0:52:13.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渐渐的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.80,0:52:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个人的感情越来越好
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.00,0:52:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后两个人合力建造一个
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.24,0:52:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人跟人类
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.61,0:52:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和平共处的理想国
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.94,0:52:27.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而那个地方就叫做虹之谷
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.28,0:52:29.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是虹之谷的故事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.18,0:52:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 这只是一个故事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.52,0:52:33.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有水没有食物的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.52,0:52:35.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早就死翘翘了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.20,0:52:50.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的沙尘暴喔
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.30,0:52:51.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.14,0:52:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有什么道具啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.04,0:52:55.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样根本没办法前进啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.27,0:52:55.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.97,0:52:58.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点想个办法呀
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.41,0:53:01.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家再加把劲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.12,0:53:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来 他们往下走了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.16,0:53:14.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.23,0:53:20.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.17,0:53:22.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本无法再往前一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.57,0:53:23.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.64,0:53:25.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.17,0:53:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.17,0:53:28.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家紧紧的靠在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.97,0:53:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.59,0:53:42.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.89,0:53:44.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们大家都没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.52,0:53:46.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好 没有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.69,0:53:48.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在走到查贝克博士说的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.09,0:53:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人面岩前
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.09,0:53:51.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家再忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.03,0:53:52.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林 西边在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.66,0:53:54.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.53,0:53:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.20,0:53:57.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 出发了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.84,0:53:59.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.18,0:54:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前进
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.15,0:54:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续往前走
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.69,0:54:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是悬崖
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.02,0:54:20.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好险喔
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.53,0:54:21.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.26,0:54:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请您继续往前走
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.74,0:54:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么一来\N这个星球就是我的了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.77,0:54:35.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把所有
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.54,0:54:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听从我的命令的机器人\N组织起来
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.24,0:54:41.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建造一个最强的机器人王国
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.65,0:54:51.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没有到吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.52,0:54:52.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.59,0:54:54.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好渴喔
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.09,0:54:55.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经不行了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.76,0:54:57.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.20,0:55:02.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.27,0:55:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有水龙头吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.94,0:55:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有的话我早就拿出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.74,0:55:08.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好难受喔
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.30,0:55:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.47,0:55:36.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.63,0:55:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一步也走不动了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.24,0:55:39.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.80,0:55:40.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.81,0:55:42.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.44,0:55:44.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位 振作一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.71,0:55:46.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林 西边在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.95,0:55:48.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.45,0:55:48.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.81,0:55:50.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.82,0:55:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.72,0:55:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是…是人面岩耶
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.82,0:55:58.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快点起来 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.72,0:56:00.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林 我现在还走得动
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.79,0:56:02.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们背大家过去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.96,0:56:04.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暂时先背到山洞里去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.72,0:56:29.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们大家分头去找水吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.99,0:56:30.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.86,0:56:32.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到山洞里面去找找看
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.99,0:56:34.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.53,0:56:36.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.19,0:56:37.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到下面去找水
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.36,0:56:39.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到上面去找
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.87,0:56:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要小心一点喔
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.94,0:57:22.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.74,0:57:24.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通的水壶
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.98,0:57:26.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.41,0:57:29.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好还剩下普通的水壶
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.83,0:57:46.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.94,0:57:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点喝水吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.74,0:57:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.85,0:58:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,捡回一条命了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.25,0:58:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.82,0:58:09.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克呢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.12,0:58:11.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克 他也去找水啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.50,0:58:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.17,0:58:28.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换我了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.47,0:58:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一个换我了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.87,0:58:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.81,0:58:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.48,0:58:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜 那我要换人喽
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.85,0:58:37.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 我要妈妈一直背我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.79,0:58:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.17,0:59:01.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种人根本别去管她的死活
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.97,0:59:03.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.37,0:59:05.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.08,0:59:07.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来我们该怎么做才好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.85,0:59:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么没有看到克鲁林啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.48,0:59:12.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到里头去了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.92,0:59:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们快来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.95,0:59:15.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁林 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.02,0:59:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快到里面看看 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.65,0:59:18.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.16,0:59:19.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.09,0:59:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在前面 帕
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.83,0:59:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面到底有什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.04,0:59:34.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种地方竟然…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.97,0:59:36.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮喔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.01,0:59:37.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒喔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.21,0:59:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.72,0:59:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想查贝克博士说的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.99,0:59:56.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该就是这里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.70,0:59:59.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.96,1:00:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.07,1:00:03.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.03,1:00:05.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请问你们有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.27,1:00:08.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父王…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.57,1:00:10.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.41,1:00:13.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父王
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.14,1:00:15.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.08,1:00:21.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人不要管我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.59,1:00:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.85,1:00:25.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您好像受伤了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.62,1:00:26.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.49,1:00:28.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们几个是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.59,1:00:29.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.73,1:00:32.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都反对\N您的机器人改造计划
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.93,1:00:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以就跟机器人在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.90,1:00:36.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起生活着
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.50,1:00:38.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.60,1:00:39.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.40,1:00:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离我远一点
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.54,1:00:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不需要机器人…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.54,1:00:45.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是机器人又怎么样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.31,1:00:46.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.54,1:00:49.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不能够暸解我的悲伤
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.05,1:00:50.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能够暸解
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.42,1:00:53.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到波克流下了眼泪耶
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.18,1:00:55.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟人类所流下来的眼泪
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.02,1:00:56.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有哪里不同啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.55,1:00:58.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是波克好不容易
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.12,1:01:00.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才把你背到这里来的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.49,1:01:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不需要机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.18,1:01:20.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜女王已经下落不明
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.41,1:01:25.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据本国的法律规定
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.15,1:01:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将成为临时指导者
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.72,1:01:32.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人有异议吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.02,1:03:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虹之谷的故事果然是真的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.69,1:03:12.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.79,1:03:14.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.33,1:03:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在了解我错了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.29,1:03:19.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来我父王一直以来\N想做的事情
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.16,1:03:20.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.67,1:03:21.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.83,1:03:23.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我们去救玛莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.77,1:03:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后遵循父王的遗志
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.04,1:03:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建造一个理想的机器人王国
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.54,1:03:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.63,1:03:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.30,1:03:54.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么做 请给我们指示
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.63,1:03:56.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.63,1:03:58.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜已经死了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.64,1:03:59.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把她赶出去
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.64,1:04:01.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 遵命
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.31,1:04:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会遵照指示赶她出去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.02,1:04:14.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是珍娜女王 快点开门
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.75,1:04:17.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔国王下令
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.22,1:04:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你马上离开
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.12,1:04:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 铁斯塔国王
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.76,1:04:22.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.96,1:04:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔一开始就利用我
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.30,1:04:28.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的目的\N就是要夺取这个国家
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.17,1:04:31.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要把你们这些机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.04,1:04:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带去改造工厂
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.74,1:04:35.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.47,1:04:38.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机器人改造计划\N现在已经终止了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.74,1:04:40.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快让我跟铁斯塔见面
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.71,1:04:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类请退到一边去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.51,1:04:44.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把铁斯塔司令官叫出来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.65,1:04:47.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快让我见我的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.82,1:04:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类请退到一边去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.79,1:04:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果要攻击的话
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.76,1:04:54.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就攻击我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.49,1:04:56.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类…
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.49,1:04:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些机器人\N是不会攻击人类的
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.93,1:05:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.87,1:05:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群没用的废物
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.75,1:05:15.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:05:15.88,1:05:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在改造你之前\N你就看个清楚吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.55,1:05:21.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.29,1:05:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.29,1:05:24.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要使出最后的手段
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.96,1:06:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,违抗我的人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.83,1:06:02.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我全都要踩烂
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.96,1:06:05.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有想到
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.50,1:06:07.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,城堡竟然是一个巨型机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.73,1:06:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.30,1:06:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点把缩小灯拿出来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.10,1:06:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,缩小灯跟放大灯一起掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.90,1:06:14.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.94,1:06:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是我们也有一个
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.84,1:06:18.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巨型的机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.01,1:06:19.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.95,1:06:23.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.45,1:06:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随意操纵机呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.35,1:06:26.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下喔
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.72,1:06:28.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随意操纵机…
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.89,1:06:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要做什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.22,1:06:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 你的竹蜻蜓里的电池
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.79,1:06:33.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该还有电吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.32,1:06:35.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.16,1:06:36.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,借我一下
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.79,1:06:38.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我回来
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.10,1:06:40.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.45,1:06:56.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这个
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.40,1:07:15.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.41,1:07:30.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.35,1:07:33.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经不行了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.65,1:07:34.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你振作一点
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.79,1:07:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们躲到岩石下面去
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.99,1:07:41.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想躲到哪去啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.39,1:07:43.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.87,1:07:49.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.10,1:07:51.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 危险
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.67,1:07:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.87,1:07:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.51,1:07:56.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.48,1:08:00.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.82,1:08:10.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你的对手
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.69,1:08:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.26,1:08:17.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄跌倒了耶
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.36,1:08:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄到底会不会操作啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.07,1:08:25.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.01,1:08:36.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是做暖身操的时候吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.88,1:08:38.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟敢耍我
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.89,1:08:52.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在那边跳什么舞呀
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.83,1:08:57.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停不下来了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.90,1:08:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在干什么呀
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.60,1:09:01.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.15,1:09:15.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.49,1:09:17.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.56,1:09:19.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还可以啦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.56,1:09:27.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多洛伊德宫殿…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.57,1:09:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.44,1:09:37.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.37,1:09:39.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 波克
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.18,1:09:41.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一次应该换我去了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.38,1:09:43.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然没有武器我还是要去
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.38,1:09:45.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们大家等我回来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.25,1:09:47.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.16,1:09:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好我有这一颗铁头
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.96,1:09:59.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我最后的武器了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.40,1:10:02.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的铁头功吧 铁斯塔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.40,1:10:04.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来喽 来了…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.54,1:10:10.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是一群笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.72,1:10:23.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.29,1:10:24.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是波克的妈妈呀
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.92,1:10:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔他人在哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.86,1:10:28.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在你后面
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.06,1:10:32.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天啊 他躺平了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.50,1:10:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.25,1:10:51.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.45,1:10:53.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.39,1:10:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不行
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.02,1:10:58.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没有办法控制了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.26,1:11:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找找看\N还有什么东西可以用啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.83,1:11:08.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再这么下去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.17,1:11:09.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火箭会被行星吸引过去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.83,1:11:12.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会因此而产生冲撞
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.67,1:11:17.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下子糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.74,1:11:19.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点想办法让它停下来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.74,1:11:21.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.61,1:11:23.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,影像连结起来了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.05,1:11:23.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.98,1:11:24.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.92,1:11:26.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.55,1:11:27.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.42,1:11:28.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们大家好
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.92,1:11:30.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.05,1:11:32.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在这里已经昏过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.49,1:11:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为刚才\N我用我的铁头去撞了他
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.36,1:11:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.06,1:11:38.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在情况不妙了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.80,1:11:40.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.26,1:11:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这架火箭要冲撞行星\N是不是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.70,1:11:46.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有什么道具可以挽救的
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.70,1:11:49.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我全都试过了可是就是不行
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.51,1:11:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 我不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.71,1:11:52.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.71,1:11:53.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.78,1:11:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.08,1:11:56.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.21,1:11:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈很高兴能再看到你
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.95,1:11:59.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛莉亚
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.22,1:12:01.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起…我…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.15,1:12:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.95,1:12:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈一直都很相信你
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.22,1:12:06.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.22,1:12:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克 你要保重喔
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.46,1:12:10.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今后跟珍娜一起
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.03,1:12:12.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同心协力的生活下去
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.80,1:12:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管发生什么事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.23,1:12:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈都会一直在你们身边的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.90,1:12:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.17,1:12:21.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你要记得写功课喔
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.54,1:12:24.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有上学千万不要迟到
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.61,1:12:28.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外就算你跟胖虎小夫打架
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.25,1:12:31.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家也都要好好的相处
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.82,1:12:32.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.55,1:12:35.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟静香两个人都要很幸福
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.85,1:12:36.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在说什么
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.92,1:12:38.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.26,1:12:39.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.49,1:12:41.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟妈妈说…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.83,1:12:42.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.83,1:12:43.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.56,1:12:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.43,1:12:46.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟妈妈说…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.43,1:12:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不可以死啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.87,1:12:56.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们又还没有撞上去 帕
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.34,1:12:56.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.94,1:12:59.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们使用电送装置吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.08,1:13:00.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.14,1:13:01.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.58,1:13:04.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火箭以这么快的速度在移动
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.15,1:13:06.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是没有他们两个人\N确切的位置
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.72,1:13:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也是没用的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.85,1:13:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.86,1:13:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克 是妈妈啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.86,1:13:15.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.66,1:13:17.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是妈妈在跟我说话
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.29,1:13:18.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,博士
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.10,1:13:21.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经知道妈妈的位置了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.38,1:13:34.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.68,1:13:36.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经快要撞上了 帕
Dialogue: 0,1:13:36.98,1:13:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.82,1:13:39.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传送
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.69,1:13:51.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.84,1:14:00.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.34,1:14:01.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.57,1:14:04.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.58,1:14:05.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.91,1:14:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.91,1:14:10.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.22,1:14:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.95,1:14:13.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.02,1:14:18.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珍娜
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.22,1:14:20.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.09,1:14:23.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.66,1:14:26.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.04,1:14:38.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多罗伊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.98,1:14:40.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮我把铁斯塔带回去
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.61,1:14:41.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.61,1:14:43.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站起来 铁斯塔
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.68,1:14:49.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔 你要彻底觉悟啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.39,1:14:51.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他长得跟查贝克博士好像喔
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.89,1:14:53.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.19,1:14:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.96,1:14:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铁斯塔 他正是我弟弟
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.06,1:15:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我们两个都是科学家
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.83,1:15:03.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过铁斯塔他却走错了路
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.71,1:15:13.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们看 是彩虹耶
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.51,1:15:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.48,1:15:16.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且还是两道呢
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.92,1:15:26.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父王
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.36,1:15:27.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是您在告诉我
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.72,1:15:28.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要建造一个
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.66,1:15:31.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的虹之谷的意思吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.94,1:15:44.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们一定要回去吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.24,1:15:46.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他们证明了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.81,1:15:48.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类跟机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.11,1:15:50.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是可以和平共处的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.81,1:15:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我们几个还是会吵架啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.62,1:15:55.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.02,1:15:57.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的是太依赖哆啦A梦了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.75,1:15:58.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.69,1:16:00.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.46,1:16:02.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到波克跟妈妈这么好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.06,1:16:03.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不由得…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.56,1:16:05.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要回去找妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.40,1:16:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.26,1:16:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.77,1:16:11.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家现在都想回去找妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.77,1:16:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.04,1:16:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作不快一点的话
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.27,1:16:16.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳就要下山了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.04,1:16:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.14,1:16:18.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.64,1:16:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波克 再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.78,1:16:22.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.65,1:16:25.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.86,1:16:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.86,1:16:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄啊 你怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.80,1:16:43.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
